# beside the planeswalker that is), and damage dealt to a planeswalker removes that many loyalty counters (CR 120.3c):
# Bot2's Liliana of the Veil, cast on turn 2 with a Black Lotus and left at 3 loyalty, is dealt 3 and goes to the graveyard.

